-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Training data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No training data is redistributed with this package. The measurements used to
fit the released models were collected from published sources; data/sources.xlsx
lists every (assay, source) pair with its reference and DOI.

The corpus includes the Ginkgo Datapoints GDPa1 dataset
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/ginkgo-datapoints/GDPa1), licensed CC BY 4.0,
and is credited here as that licence requires.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following are optional or required dependencies, installed separately and
governed by their own licences, not by this one:

  ANARCI            BSD 3-Clause   antibody numbering (required for `feat`)
  AbLang2           BSD 3-Clause   default sequence embedding
  ImmuneBuilder     optional       structure prediction, when not supplied
  ESM-2             optional       alternative sequence embedding

